// ------------------------------------------------------------
// OPEN MENU: L2 + Options (controller) / Backspace (keyboard)
// NAVIGATE: D-Pad Up/Down | SELECT: Cross | BACK: Circle
// ADJUST VALUES: Left/Right (±1)
// SWITCH PROFILE: L2 + Triangle / Capslock
//
// MODULES:
// - ExecutePrime: Executes your Prime (R1+L1)
// - Auto Ping: Auto pings on ADS+Shoot
// - Crouch Shot: Spams crouch while shooting
// - Evasive Edge: Strafe while shooting
// - Keyboard: Keyboard commands
// - Always Run: Sends a L3 press when the stick moves
// - VM Speed: Virtual Machine speed
// - Thief Dash Tech: Thief's slide dash tech
// - Anti Recoil (Basic): Basic per weapon Anti Recoil. Toggle: Minus key
// - Rapid Fire: Spams R2 clicks while holding R2. Toggle: Equal key
// - Auto Run KB: Auto runs on Keyboard when you press I, stops on WASD
// - Weapon Data: Weapon selector, no recoil values
//
// KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS:
// Minus = Anti Recoil (Basic)
// Equal = Rapid Fire
//
// 2 profiles: Primary, Secondary.
//
